  "_about": "Where every movable thing sits: a desktop layout per side of the toggle (film, performance) and one phone layout for both sides, kept under film.phone. zone: 'hero' puts it on the hero's desk (x, y in % of the hero), 'page' anywhere below the hero (x in % of the page width, y in % of the main column). A window of the page itself (win-…) keeps its place in the flow and is nudged from it: x in % of the column's width, y in px; on the phone a window is lifted off the flow instead (zone 'page', x and y in % of the page, by its top left corner) and the page closes up where it was. hide: true leaves it out of that layout. On the desktop a thing with no entry on the performance side sits where the film side puts it; with no entry anywhere it stays where the markup puts it. Edited at /admin, which saves this file out."
}
